{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Before humanity existed, Earth was ruled by the Existentials: colossal conscious beings capable of shaping reality. They created lesser races to serve them, but not all accepted that fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Some chose to rebel.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bereshipsis</strong> is a turn-based tactical RPG where you lead a team of rebellious Existentials determined to defy their creators and prevent the end of the world. Choose wisely, act strategically, and face a collapsing future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798630/extras/hidden_Sumerian_truth.gif?t=1753472410\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>Move your team across a hexagonal board. Push enemies across the map, turn invisible, upgrade your attacks and skills, teleport, and even control your enemies if you wish!</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798630/extras/mage-fireball-skill-tree.gif?t=1753472410\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10 playable characters. Each has its own mechanics and upgrade tree so you can enjoy multiple ways to play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">100+ effects that can be applied in combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Vision is limited for both you and your enemies. You can expand it using skills, items, or attacks, but enemies also have their own vision system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat enemy minions mid\u2011battle to collect essence and unlock exclusive upgrades. If you eliminate your own minions, you deny resources to your rival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine genetic and apocalyptic attacks, and counter with defenses specialized against each damage type.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 save\u2011file slots.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each Existential has one or two \u201cFormalities.\u201d Like rock\u2011paper\u2011scissors, each formality has an advantage over another, granting you exclusive bonuses according to your choice: Colossus, Predator, Invader, Occultist, Analyst, Acrobat, or Changeling. Choose your favorite!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Handmade love and chaos in every pixel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">11 challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Do you feel the clocks stop?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make time move again and add <strong>Bereshipsis</strong> to your wishlist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798630/extras/4d88c1aac92262585a94714b93ed28eb.poster.avif?t=1753472410\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798630/extras/4d88c1aac92262585a94714b93ed28eb.webm?t=1753472410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3798630?t=1753472410","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3798630?t=1753472410","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798630/49365553db0b3c11fd37294e3cf057cab3f7d85a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753472410","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798630/49365553db0b3c11fd37294e3cf057cab3f7d85a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753472410","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}