minions, you deny resources to your rival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine genetic and apocalyptic attacks, and counter with defenses specialized against each damage type.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 save\u2011file slots.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each Existential has one or two \u201cFormalities.\u201d Like rock\u2011paper\u2011scissors, each formality has an advantage over another, granting you exclusive bonuses according to your choice: Colossus, Predator, Invader, Occultist, Analyst, Acrobat, or Changeling. Choose your favorite!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Handmade love and chaos in every pixel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">11 challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Do you feel the clocks stop?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make time move again and add <strong>Bereshipsis</strong> to your wishlist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798630/extras/4d88c1aac92262585a94714b93ed28eb.poster.avif?t=1753472410\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798630/extras/4d88c1aac92262585a94714b93ed28eb.webm?t=1753472410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p>","developers":["Vic"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798630/d782ab38e648832ed0b6fb7621b0cde900e3b1d4/header.jpg?t=1753472410","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257153177,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257153177/movie480.mp4?t=1750621708","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257153177/movie_max.mp4?t=1750621708"},"name":"Bereshipsis Traile